OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 5 MAR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Sibelius
OL,5,     GKate Molleson delves into the
OL,6,     Giconic Fifth Symphony by Jean
OL,7,     GSibelius - and its famed
OL,8,     Gprogrammatic depiction of swans.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GDanny Driver plays live in the
OL,11,     Gstudio and Musical Director of
OL,12,     Gthe Bach Choir, David Hill.
OL,13,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,14,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,15,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,16,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,17,     GThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,18,     GWales and Ryan Bancroft perform
OL,19,     GHillborg's Exquisite Corpse,
OL,20,     GShostakovich's 2nd Cello Concerto
OL,21,     Gwith Alban Gerhardt and
OL,22,     GSibelius's Lemminkainen Suite.
